  "url": "https://www.beatlesbible.com/2018/06/20/paul-mccartney-announces-egypt-station-new-album/",
  "type": "history",
  "slug": "paul-mccartney-announces-egypt-station-new-album",
  "title": "Paul McCartney announces new album Egypt Station | 2018",
  "date": "2018-06-20",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- ast-no-thumb single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p><a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> has announced Egypt Station, his 17th solo studio album. <span id=\"more-50036\"></span></p><p>It will be released by Capitol Records on 7 September 2018, on compact disc, standard 140g vinyl, limited edition 180g deluxe coloured vinyl, and a super deluxe box set.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-50213\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"50213\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1200,1200\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney – Egypt Station cover artwork\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station_01-960x960.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station_01-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"Paul McCartney – Egypt Station cover artwork\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-50213\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station_01-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station_01-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station_01-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station_01-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station_01-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station_01.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>The announcement follows a series of cryptic messages on McCartney’s social media accounts, beginning on 10 June 2018 with a doodle which appeared to show a pyramid or train track:</p><div class=\"embed-twitter\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"zxx\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://t.co/TZ8VeKEv8f\">pic.twitter.com/TZ8VeKEv8f</a></p><p>— Paul McCartney (@PaulMcCartney) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/PaulMcCartney/status/1005845990979534850?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">June 10, 2018</a></p></blockquote><p></p></div><p>There were also six monochrome shots, of musical equipment or McCartney alone in a recording studio, leading to speculation that the new album title might be McCartney III.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2018/06/20/paul-mccartney-announces-egypt-station-new-album/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-50036 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTQwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"140\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_02-140x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_02-140x200.jpg 140w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_02-406x580.jpg 406w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_02-672x960.jpg 672w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_02.jpg 700w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 140px) 100vw, 140px\" data-attachment-id=\"50039\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"700,1000\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_02-672x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_03/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTQwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"140\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_03-140x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_03-140x200.jpg 140w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_03-406x580.jpg 406w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_03-672x960.jpg 672w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_03-768x1097.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_03-1075x1536.jpg 1075w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_03.jpg 1400w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 140px) 100vw, 140px\" data-attachment-id=\"50040\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1400,2000\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_03-672x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_04/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNDQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTQ0IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_04-144x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_04-144x200.jpg 144w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_04-417x580.jpg 417w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_04-690x960.jpg 690w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_04-768x1068.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_04-1105x1536.jpg 1105w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_04.jpg 1473w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 144px) 100vw, 144px\" data-attachment-id=\"50041\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1473,2048\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_04-690x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_05/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTQwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE0MCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"140\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_05-200x140.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_05-200x140.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_05-580x406.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_05-960x672.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_05-768x538.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_05.jpg 1200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"50042\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_05/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_05.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1200,840\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_05-960x672.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_06/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTQwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE0MCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"140\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_06-200x140.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_06-200x140.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_06-580x406.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_06-960x672.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_06-768x538.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_06.jpg 1200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"50043\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_06/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_06.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1200,840\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_06-960x672.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_07/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTQwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE0MCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"140\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_07-200x140.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_07-200x140.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_07-580x405.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_07-960x670.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_07-768x536.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_07.jpg 1200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"50044\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_07/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_07.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1200,838\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney&nbsp;–&nbsp;social media photograph, 2018\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-social_07-960x670.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>On 17 June a train ticket image was posted, establishing the theme for the album’s artwork:</p><div class=\"embed-twitter\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"zxx\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://t.co/ptpbhvghNt\">pic.twitter.com/ptpbhvghNt</a></p><p>— Paul McCartney (@PaulMcCartney) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/PaulMcCartney/status/1008258088338644993?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">June 17, 2018</a></p></blockquote><p></p></div><p>The first key clue to the title was an image of a torn ticket, which appeared to show the letters “…PT” and “…ON” along with some faint heirglyphics:</p><div class=\"embed-twitter\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"zxx\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://t.co/znKZ84KRH8\">pic.twitter.com/znKZ84KRH8</a></p><p>— Paul McCartney (@PaulMcCartney) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/PaulMcCartney/status/1008378848596103168?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">June 17, 2018</a></p></blockquote><p></p></div><p>On the morning of 18 June, McCartney’s birthday, a new image was published which featured pyramids and palm trees, the clearest indication that the new release would have an Egypt theme.</p><div class=\"embed-twitter\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"zxx\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://t.co/351RbE9Agh\">pic.twitter.com/351RbE9Agh</a></p><p>— Paul McCartney (@PaulMcCartney) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/PaulMcCartney/status/1008620463378128902?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">June 18, 2018</a></p></blockquote><p></p></div><p>The full title was revealed later in the day:</p><div class=\"embed-twitter\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\" data-width=\"550\" data-dnt=\"true\"><p lang=\"qme\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/PaulMcCartney?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#PaulMcCartney</a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/EgyptStation?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">#EgyptStation</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/40o6Mo81lB\">pic.twitter.com/40o6Mo81lB</a></p><p>— Paul McCartney (@PaulMcCartney) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/PaulMcCartney/status/1008741169524768768?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">June 18, 2018</a></p></blockquote><p></p></div><p>The first single from the album was the double a-side <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/songs/i-dont-know/\">I Don’t Know</a>/<a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/songs/come-on-to-me/\">‘Come On To Me’</a>, which was released on the same day of the album’s announcement.</p><p>Egypt Station was originally a piece of art by Paul McCartney. Two hundred lithographs went on sale in 1988.</p><blockquote><div>200 Impressions<br>\nPaper size: 25 ½” x 33 ½”<br>\nImage size: 15 ½” x 19 ½”</div></blockquote><p><a href=\"/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-1988_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-50037\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1ODciIGhlaWdodD0iNDg1IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNTg3IDQ4NSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"50037\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-1988_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-1988_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"587,485\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Egypt Station&nbsp;artwork by Paul McCartney, 1988\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-1988_01.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-1988_01.jpg\" alt=\"Egypt Station&nbsp;artwork by Paul McCartney, 1988\" width=\"587\" height=\"485\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-50037\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-1988_01.jpg 587w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-1988_01-580x479.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/paul-mccartney-egypt-station-1988_01-200x165.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 587px) 100vw, 587px\"></a></p><p>Here’s McCartney’s description of the artwork, from the <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20191205060630/http://mccartneyart.com:80/product/egypt-station/\">McCartney Art website</a>:</p><blockquote><div>My original inspiration was similar to a picture we were talking about the other day, with Egyptian symbols and shapes I got from looking at a reference book on Egypt. I was interested in the way they drew sunflowers, so two appear on the left and on the right. It was a nice shape, so I took that and then I also love the way they symbolize trees. I like the way they reduce a tree to just some very simple symbols.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Paul McCartney</div>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 18 June 2025</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2025: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2025/06/20/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-hard-rock-live-hollywood-5/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Hard Rock Live, Hollywood</a></li><li>2018: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2018/06/20/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-wiener-stadthalle-vienna/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Wiener Stadthalle, Vienna</a></li><li>2014: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2014/06/20/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-count-basie-theatre-red-bank/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Count Basie Theatre, Red Bank</a></li><li>2012: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2012/06/20/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-american-music-theatre-lancaster-2/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: American Music Theatre, Lancaster</a></li><li>2011: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2011/06/20/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-symphony-hall-birmingham/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Symphony Hall, Birmingham</a></li><li>2010: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2010/06/20/paul-mccartney-live-hampden-park-glasgow/\">Paul McCartney live: Hampden Park, Glasgow</a></li><li>2008: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2008/06/20/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-casino-rama-7/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Casino Rama, Rama</a></li><li>2004: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2004/06/20/paul-mccartney-live-palace-square-st-petersburg/\">Paul McCartney live: Palace Square, St Petersburg</a></li><li>1995: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1995/06/20/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-kosei-nenkin-kaikan-hiroshima/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Kōsei Nenkin Kaikan, Hiroshima</a></li><li>1992: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1992/06/20/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-radio-city-music-hall-new-york-city-2/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Radio City Music Hall, New York City</a></li><li>1979: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1979/06/20/filming-arrow-through-me-wings/\">Filming: Arrow Through Me by Wings</a></li><li>1968: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1968/06/20/recording-revolution-9-2/\">Recording: Revolution 9</a></li><li>1968: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1968/06/20/paul-mccartney-flies-to-new-york/\">Paul McCartney flies to New York</a></li><li>1966: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1966/06/20/mixing-got-to-get-you-into-my-life-2/\">Mixing: Got To Get You Into My Life</a></li><li>1965: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/06/20/live-palais-des-sports-paris/\">The Beatles’ European tour begins at the Palais des Sport, Paris</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/06/20/live-sydney-stadium-sydney-3/\">The Beatles live: Sydney Stadium, Sydney</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/06/20/john-lennon-apologises-for-assaulting-bob-wooler/\">John Lennon apologises for assaulting Bob Wooler</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/06/20/the-beatles-ltd-is-formed/\">The Beatles Ltd is formed</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/06/20/live-cavern-club-liverpool-182/\">The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (evening)</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/06/20/live-cavern-club-liverpool-181/\">The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (lunchtime)</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/06/20/live-top-ten-club-hamburg-81/\">The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, Hamburg</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div>",
  "textContent": "Paul McCartney has announced Egypt Station, his 17th solo studio album. It will be released by Capitol Records on 7 September 2018, on compact disc, standard 140g vinyl, limited edition 180g deluxe coloured vinyl, and a super deluxe box set.The announcement follows a series of cryptic messages on McCartney’s social media accounts, beginning on 10 June 2018 with a doodle which appeared to show a pyramid or train track:pic.twitter.com/TZ8VeKEv8f— Paul McCartney (@PaulMcCartney) June 10, 2018There were also six monochrome shots, of musical equipment or McCartney alone in a recording studio, leading to speculation that the new album title might be McCartney III.\n\n\n\n\n\nOn 17 June a train ticket image was posted, establishing the theme for the album’s artwork:pic.twitter.com/ptpbhvghNt— Paul McCartney (@PaulMcCartney) June 17, 2018The first key clue to the title was an image of a torn ticket, which appeared to show the letters “…PT” and “…ON” along with some faint heirglyphics:pic.twitter.com/znKZ84KRH8— Paul McCartney (@PaulMcCartney) June 17, 2018On the morning of 18 June, McCartney’s birthday, a new image was published which featured pyramids and palm trees, the clearest indication that the new release would have an Egypt theme.pic.twitter.com/351RbE9Agh— Paul McCartney (@PaulMcCartney) June 18, 2018The full title was revealed later in the day:#PaulMcCartney #EgyptStation pic.twitter.com/40o6Mo81lB— Paul McCartney (@PaulMcCartney) June 18, 2018The first single from the album was the double a-side I Don’t Know/‘Come On To Me’, which was released on the same day of the album’s announcement.Egypt Station was originally a piece of art by Paul McCartney. Two hundred lithographs went on sale in 1988.200 Impressions\nPaper size: 25 ½” x 33 ½”\nImage size: 15 ½” x 19 ½”Here’s McCartney’s description of the artwork, from the McCartney Art website:My original inspiration was similar to a picture we were talking about the other day, with Egyptian symbols and shapes I got from looking at a reference book on Egypt. I was interested in the way they drew sunflowers, so two appear on the left and on the right. It was a nice shape, so I took that and then I also love the way they symbolize trees. I like the way they reduce a tree to just some very simple symbols.Paul McCartney\nPage last updated: 18 June 2025Also on this day...2025: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Hard Rock Live, Hollywood2018: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Wiener Stadthalle, Vienna2014: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Count Basie Theatre, Red Bank2012: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: American Music Theatre, Lancaster2011: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Symphony Hall, Birmingham2010: Paul McCartney live: Hampden Park, Glasgow2008: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Casino Rama, Rama2004: Paul McCartney live: Palace Square, St Petersburg1995: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Kōsei Nenkin Kaikan, Hiroshima1992: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Radio City Music Hall, New York City1979: Filming: Arrow Through Me by Wings1968: Recording: Revolution 91968: Paul McCartney flies to New York1966: Mixing: Got To Get You Into My Life1965: The Beatles’ European tour begins at the Palais des Sport, Paris1964: The Beatles live: Sydney Stadium, Sydney1963: John Lennon apologises for assaulting Bob Wooler1963: The Beatles Ltd is formed1962: The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (evening)1962: The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (lunchtime)1961: The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, HamburgWant more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
